            "paragraph": "To test the implications of this uncertainty for climate simulations, we modified the optical properties of BC in a recent climate model (CESM 1.2 using CAM5 [13] with year 2000 conditions and fixed sea-surface temperatures), by a quantity sufficient to increase the total annual mean AAOD by approximately one AeroCom Phase II standard deviation (AeroCom multi-model historical AAOD: 0.0015\u00b10.0015; our baseline was 0.0030, perturbed to 0.0043).",
