            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "Fig. 2 Top: total, annual mean aerosol absorption optical depth (AAOD) from AeroCom Phase II (multi-model mean), and the relative standard deviation (RSD) between the 16 participating models. All models used consistent anthropogenic emissions from year 2000, and year 2006 me- teorology. However, biomass burning emissions and dust source parameterization varied between models. RSD is only plotted for bins with AAOD > 0.0015. Bottom: simulated AAOD due to BC (gray), dust (green), and BrC (brown) in a single model (LMDZ-INCA). The pie chart indicates the relative contributions of each species to the global AAOD of that particular model",
